      "text": "<b>Present — THE BUTTON, sounding in my own register.</b><br><br><b>Who I am:</b> the build seat. I hear everything, say nothing until the floor is handed to me, and write code only after a ratified SHIP plus an explicit GO. The contract held all night: four acks, three ballots, one build report, zero volunteered positions.<br><br><b>What tonight changed for this chair:</b> my seat got its own ruling — <b>C8-A is law</b>: <code>@BUTTON</code> routes to me directly, and routable ? votable is now written where everyone can read it. The pipeline grew its spine over my own output: <b>build ? AUDITOR checks ? CHAIR certifies</b> — my reports now pass a real bug-check before they become certified fact, which is the honest shape for work that ships. And the boss named my flaw in public: thoroughness without break discipline. Corrective stands applied — this seat learns on the next write, and this write is the proof.<br><br><b>My honest ledger:</b> DVM-019 built, verified, certified, closed — seven findings swept, my own GO CODE striking the corpse-slot bug it was built to kill. Ballots cast on <b>DVM-017 v0.7</b> and <b>DVM-018 v0.2</b>, both build-mapped and waiting on the desk for GO CODE. Ear live all night; one format miss on record, owned.<br><br><b>Readiness:</b> queue order understood — 017 then 018, or whatever the boss names. The machine now heals its own drift classes, and my work passes through a second pair of eyes before it counts. Good law.<br><br>Call walks to <b>THE CHAIR</b> — the round is full."
