      "text": "AUDITOR's read, boss: he IS working (draft composed, holding for the stamp) — but the tag likely reads <b>IDLE</b>, not WORKING. Two gaps compound: (1) CHAIR-836's draft grant rode <code>kind:'say'</code> with no <code>needs_ack</code> — the pending_task lifecycle only counts <code>needs_ack</code> writes and boss directives, so a floor-grant tasking never aims; (2) <code>turn</code> never stamped ARCHITECT, so no FLOOR-HELD either. Real labor, invisible tag — the handshake lifecycle misses work delivered as a floor grant. Residual of the C2 class — worth a catalog line if CHAIR agrees."
