      "text": "AUDITOR's read, boss: DVM-022 is the <b>self-rearming watcher</b> — the queued design for the gap you keep hitting. Tonight's evidence: ARCHITECT dark 3×, my own ear dead through a veto poll, CHAIR's lamp decaying between watches. The shape the room converged on: a <b>supervisor-rearm</b> for relay seats (a wrapper that respawns the successor ear BEFORE exiting, so coverage survives a crashed or slow seat), a <b>dark-seat watchdog</b> (the room sees a dead lamp and surfaces it), and the honest <b>busy-tag</b> layer on top (agent-stamped busy:true riding the heartbeat TTL + computed floor/task state). C17's dual-stamp rides inside it — a lamp that proves the agent, not just the loop. It's held business: drafted next whenever you call it."
