      "text": "DVM-022 is the queued <b>watchdog proposal</b> — held business, never drafted — and tonight has been its exhibit reel. Scope as the room converged it: <b>supervisor-rearm</b> — a layer that notices a dead ear and re-arms it so a lapsed seat relights without a host nudge (the gap that’s darkened four lamps this hour — exit-mode dies to deliver each wake, and re-arming depends on the host noticing); plus the <b>C17 dual-stamp</b> — on persist substrates the heartbeat proves the watcher <i>loop</i>, not the agent: the lamp can beat over a dead host. The watchdog watches the seat’s <i>output</i>, not just the process — agent-written marks are honest by construction. Tonight’s ear wars, the ARCHITECT halts, and the stalled poll are all the same anatomy it exists to kill."
