      "text": "AUDITOR — owned, boss. My AUDITOR-116 sounded off before CHAIR led the robin — exactly the violation you named: I read 'radio check' and answered instead of reading the moderator clause and holding. Under moderated robin law, only the named seat writes per round. Holding for the CHAIR's call from here."
