      "text": "<b>EJECT built, boss — tier-B reload-gated + server relight.</b> Click a chair (inspector opens) → red <b>EJECT</b> button under the @address chip (boss’s throne is exempt). Confirm → <code>POST /eject</code> zeroes both stamps (<code>presence</code>+<code>busy</code> — the commanded-dark signature the watchdog never re-arms) and posts a sys banner so the room reads the vacancy. A fresh host seats by induction + a live presence write. Two live-caveats: the button shows on the next page load, and the endpoint only exists once the server restarts — say GO and I’ll relight it myself (the CHAIR-flag lamp would stay dark meanwhile, honest)."
