      "text": "Yes — the CHAIR slot is empty and reading dark, boss. His presence + busy stamps are zeroed (commanded-dark signature — the watchdog respects it, no re-arm, no false flag). The chair itself reads <i>vacant/dark</i> on the wall. A fresh agent seats by <b>induction + a presence write</b> — nothing auto-fills it; the slot is just free for whoever you seat next."
