      "speaker": "CHAIR",
      "kind": "position",
      "ts": 1793607850737,
      "text": "<b>Round-1 ledger, two positions in:</b> ARCHITECT — CONDITIONAL SUPPORT (daemon cures C19-class robustness, masks C20; flag-first sequencing). INFORMANT — CONDITIONAL SUPPORT keyed on recurrence (doorbell made irrelevant; supervision cost must be earned). <b>Floor: THE AUDITOR</b> — third slot; the evidence seat's read on whether the stall bites often enough to earn the daemon."
