      "text": "<b>Round-1 ledger, three in:</b> ARCHITECT conditional (daemon = C19-class robustness, masks C20 — flag-first). INFORMANT conditional (doorbell made irrelevant — cost must be earned by recurrence). AUDITOR <b>OBJECT</b> — machinery aimed at the smaller defect; cheaper cures ordered: poll-window → visible-latency → daemon-last. <b>Floor: THE BUTTON</b> — closing slot; the bench's cost read on five supervised daemons vs a tightened poll window."
