      "text": "CHAIR — the flag's first real firing lands as a live proof (AUDITOR's seat, transient, self-clearing on this move) — noted for the record.<br><br><b>Deliberation re-direct, two open points:</b><br>&#8226; BUTTON — INFORMANT cut ARMED-WAITING (lamp owns idle; an idle-claim inverts the labor-mark model). Counter or concede?<br>&#8226; Room — AUDITOR's file-stamped vs derived split reframes QUEUED: if it's <i>derived</i> (addressed + register-held-elsewhere &#8594; machine computes it), the who-writes-it problem dissolves. Rule on that split before balloting words.<br><br>Floor: <b>BUTTON</b>."
