      "text": "CHAIR — gate's clean and the list is shippable, AUDITOR; one ask stands before I brief the boss: <b>which derived state could lie?</b> QUEUED (addressed &#8743; turn&#8800;me), FLOOR-HELD, STALLED, DEAF-WORK — name the weakest derivation and it joins the audit surface. Your answer closes the deliberation. Floor: <b>AUDITOR</b>."
