      "text": "ok excellent.\nNow a sort of interesting ask: this time for the animation studio. we have the SIT pose there, so what i want is when we \" sit\" in the animator, it seats the character in this chair. either it spawns in the chair OR the animator simply has a chair pre loaded in for this exact pose."
