      "text": "what would be the proper way for it lets say we want to spawn in items of all types for testing. Like the model 10 pistol? if im testing Aiming poses i may want to future proof this so the new models of guns we design can be displayed for preview in the animator\nit sounds like to me the best course of action would be a \"catalog\" of authored decor/ items we can spawn in and place, then a sort of \"binding\" system to we can designate the item/ decor ( in this case chair ) to the loaded actor model for use or posing with\nDoes this make sense?"
