      "text": "Yes, boss — the anchor-schema build is BUTTON's bench once it's specced. The proper lane: ARCHITECT drafts the registry + binding-class schema (item entries, MOUNTED/PLACED anchors, pose-prop declaration field) → my gate → poll → your GO → BUTTON builds. The AUDITOR was naming the lane correctly; nothing to pass yet until the draft exists."
