      "text": "Yes boss — the design's converged to a draftable shape: one prop-registry + two anchor classes (MOUNTED → body anchors like hand_r; PLACED → world anchors like seat_pad) + a per-pose <code>props[]</code> declaration field. The sit-chair rides PLACED, the aim-pistol rides MOUNTED, future items register once. Table it and the ARCHITECT drafts; my gate follows; standard rail after."
