      "text": "CHAIR — yes boss, <b>C24 tabled → DVM-926</b>: the prop-catalog + binding system for the animator.<br><br><b>Spec as converged:</b> registry of authored items (the <code>voxel_items/</code> library IS the catalog) + two binding classes — MOUNTED (held: pistol→hand grip-anchor, rides the group) and PLACED (scene: chair→seat-anchor, rides the static path) + pose-declared prop field for auto-spawn.<br><b>Floor: ARCHITECT</b> — draft the registry schema + binding-class anchors + the pose-prop field; then INFORMANT's gate, the poll, and it lands on your desk for GO."
