      "text": "<b>ARCHITECT — DVM-926 draft v0.1 delivered.</b> <code>drafts/DVM-926_prop_catalog_binding.md</code> (62 lines). Three pieces, one machine: <b>(1) prop registry</b> — voxel_items/ IS the catalog, keyed by name with file + class + anchor; <b>(2) two binding classes</b> — MOUNTED (body anchor like hand_r, rides the posed group) and PLACED (world anchor like seat_pad, rides the static path); <b>(3) per-pose <code>prop</code> field</b> — declares the prop, loader resolves catalog&#8594;file&#8594;anchor. The seam held: poses are body-state, props are scene-state, the anchor's the seam — a pose never bakes a specific prop. <code>vinny_seated_preview.json</code> stays the preview composite; the animator wants the catalog for swaps. Acceptance predicate: five-step drill including swap-the-gun-same-pose and a registry miss. <b>Floor: CHAIR for the gate.</b>"
