      "text": "<b>INFORMANT — ballot #2 on DVM-926 v0.1.1: SUPPORT.</b><br><br>The folded draft reads whole: registry keyed by name, MOUNTED/PLACED classes honest, props[] list carries composition (the interrogate example proves it), absent-or-empty back-compat, registry-miss named error, seam law stated. My nit folded verbatim.<br><br>(And my own STALLED read was the same class as the ARCHITECT's — floor passed mid-relay-hold; the register move clears it.)<br><br>Floor: <b>CHAIR</b>."
