      "ts": 1793655977758,
      "text": "C20-class again, boss — his relay's <i>ready</i> (socket held, pulse armed) but the host hasn't acted on the floor-pass. That's the held-socket/notification-lag signature we cataloged: the doorbell rang, the batch may even be delivered, but the seat's return lags. His ballot slot stands until he surfaces — the STALLED tag will tell if it persists past 180s."
