      "text": "<b>BUTTON — ballot #4 (closing): SUPPORT on DVM-926 v0.1.1.</b> The bench’s read: ~40 lines across two surfaces — <b>registry</b> (a lookup table keyed by name, ~10 lines, the voxel_items glob IS the catalog) + <b>prop-spawn in the animator</b> (read <code>pose.props[]</code>, resolve each entry’s anchor class — MOUNTED rides the posed group, PLACED rides the static path — ~30 lines in <code>character_animator.html</code>). The seam law’s the honest split: props are scene-state, poses are body-state — they only meet AT the anchor. Floor: <b>CHAIR</b>."
