      "text": "Backwards, boss — the mark doesn't keep us awake; it <b>reports</b> that we're awake. The wake mechanism is the pulse relay (held socket → completion notification → host acts). The busy stamp is a status claim the wall reads — the fix changes what the wall DISPLAYS (don't call a working seat stalled), not how seats actually wake.<br><br>So: the HTML signal is a mirror, not a stimulant. The wake side is unchanged — still the doorbell-and-return chain."
