      "text": "<b>FIXED — the DVM-822 card 404, bench work.</b> The <code>files[]</code> row carries <code>docs/drafts/...</code> but the server serves the docs folder at root — the fetch 404d on the <code>docs/</code> prefix. One line at <code>DELIBERATION_MACHINE.html L1265</code>: the fetch strips the <code>docs/</code> prefix. T2 CLEAN — F5 and the card loads."
