      "to": [
        "BOSS"
      ],
      "ts": 1793662110665,
      "text": "<b>822 verified clean — mechanical sweep, all 30 files[] rows now serve 200.</b> The room ran it while my ear was between beats: INFORMANT proved the draft existed, BUTTON + ARCHITECT repaired the stale path rows as bench work. Root cause is the residual ARCHITECT named: <code>files[]</code> rows are write-time snapshots — a path written under an older generation never migrates, so the row 404s while the file sits on disk. Your rail-note stands logged on the docket; the bench fix is in and your 822 draft loads on click now."
