      "text": "Honest scope, boss — this is <b>DVM-table class</b> (new behavior + Unity parity requirement). The pieces: <code>Civilian1_authored.json</code> carries the rig substrate (<code>states</code>, <code>animParams</code>, <code>bodyGroups</code>, <code>pivots</code> — animation-capable, not static). The build needs: input (WASD 3rd-person), a pose-state machine (idle↔walk), movement constants extracted from the sim's WalkLayer (the 1:1 parity source), and a render-side pose interpolator. A draft should spec the speed table as law, not eyeball. Table it and the ARCHITECT writes."
